## Shortlist
Two event days plus three hotel nights for 220 attendees. Flight time is the average from our hub.
data cities = city,venue per day,flight h,hotel per night,largest room,total cost; Lisbon,18500,3.5,165,300,145900; Prague,14200,2.0,138,260,119480; Vienna,21800,1.8,189,320,168340; Krakow,11900,2.5,112,190,97720; Seville,16400,3.8,149,280,131140; Athens,15100,3.6,131,250,116660; Dublin,23900,2.2,204,340,182440
