!! Krakow's largest room seats only 190, fewer than the 220 attendees, so Krakow is out.

## Total cost
Two venue days plus 660 hotel room nights (220 rooms for 3 nights), in euros.
chart hbar cities x=city y=total cost unit=€ focus="Prague" title="Total cost for 220 people"

## Trade-offs
table = City,Total cost,Flight,Verdict; Krakow,"€97,720",2.5 h,Out: room seats 190; Athens,"€116,660",3.6 h,Cheapest that fits; **Prague**,"**€119,480**",**2.0 h**,**Recommended**; Seville,"€131,140",3.8 h,Longer flight; Lisbon,"€145,900",3.5 h,Longer flight; Vienna,"€168,340",1.8 h,Shortest flight; Dublin,"€182,440",2.2 h,Most expensive

## Recommendation
We recommend **Prague**. It costs only €2,820 more than Athens, with a flight 1.6 h shorter, and its largest room seats 260.
